# No auto-install / relaunch

- Do **not** run Gradle `assemble*` / `installDebug`, `adb install`, or force-stop/relaunch the app unless the user explicitly asks to install or run.
- Prefer compile or unit tests only when needed to verify your own change; avoid full `installDebug`.
- When multiple agents work in parallel, never all install to the emulator — at most one agent installs, and only if the user asked.
